acceptance_criteria: The configured sync generation and package changelog check agree on real temporary trackers; Keep dependency pins and all coverage thresholds unchanged and record a behavioral revert failure
comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-08T03:15:59.514Z",pi-agent,"PR #14 reaches changelog verification after its tests pass. The reusable workflow injects --no-pending-release for its default changelog:full script, but the package checker expects its ordinary full generation. Select a caller-owned changelog:automation alias to preserve the canonical policy and compare real generated bytes with the existing check in a temporary tracker. REST refresh alone cannot repair this mismatch. Dependency pins, thresholds, native item histories and the delegated changelog implementation remain unchanged."
  "2026-11-08T03:24:59.665Z",pi-agent,"The real temporary-tracker regression passes 1 of 1 and local typecheck passes. In a disposable copy, reverting only the caller post-import-script selection fails the existing changelog check, while restoring it passes 1 of 1. The exact pinned reusable workflow declares the string input and conditionally adds the differing flag only for its default changelog:full name. Node test concurrency remains capped at two. Full npm and Bun release checks will run sequentially after the focused verification."
  "2026-11-08T04:07:30.521Z",pi-agent,"The final real-tracker fixture clears inherited Git repository selection, PM-root overrides, npm user-config policy variants and Node test context before setting its isolated paths. Credential-shaped keys are removed. The refined fixture still passes 1 of 1 and typecheck passes. Product configuration, dependency pins and thresholds are unchanged."
  "2026-11-08T05:48:02.875Z",pi-agent,"Local npm run release:check and bun run release:check pass at unchanged thresholds. npm coverage suite 1627/1627 with 0 skipped; bun coverage suite 1627/1627 with 0 skipped. The real temporary-tracker regression, final fixture isolation, typecheck and isolated caller-configuration revert all pass. Exact-head CI remains the full remote gate before orchestrator review."
  "2026-11-08T05:48:12.173Z",pi-agent,"Review handoff: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-hypothesis/pull/23. Final CI is visible at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-hypothesis/pull/23/checks. Local npm/Bun release gates, focused regression, typecheck and behavioral revert pass. All tracker writes are completed before final-head CI observation. Release this agent claim for orchestrator verification; the item stays in progress."
